2026-07-27  L. Mollicone  <@chulofiasco)

	* Version 2.18 (AIX 1.3 Port).

	* configure: Remove 'mkdir -p' usage and score file touching logic
	  to allow unprivileged configuration.

	* tests/common, tests/battlestar.test, tests/pom.test: Replace 'printf'
	  with 'echo "...\c"' and avoid unsupported export syntaxes. Skip tests
	  relying on missing '/dev/full' character device.

	* pom/pom.c: Replace unsupported '%e' strftime specifier with '%d'.

	* wargames/wargames: Replace 'echo -n' with 'echo "...\c"'. Remove
	  here-documents to avoid '/tmp' permissions issues. Update hardcoded paths.

	* countmail/countmail: Replace POSIX math '$(())' with 'expr'. Replace
	  POSIX string stripping with 'sed'.

	* wtf/wtf.in: Replace POSIX '[[:space:]]' character class with literal 
	  space and tab in sed pipeline.

	* caesar/rot13.in: Add missing '#!/bin/sh' shebang.

	* PORTING-AIX13.md: Add documentation on game compatibility and gameplay.
	  Exclude dab, banner, fortune, factor, and dm from build.

	* ChangeLog: Rename old ChangeLog to ChangeLog.1, start new.
